---
title: "getAccountLiquidity (Compound V2: Comptroller)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_assets: assets = accountAssets[account]
    q_get_assets --> q_iter: sumCollateral = 0; sumBorrowPlusEffects = 0
    q_iter --> q_get_snapshot: for each asset in assets
    q_get_snapshot --> q_snapshot_fail: getAccountSnapshot fails
    q_snapshot_fail --> [*]: return (SNAPSHOT_ERROR, 0, 0)
    q_get_snapshot --> q_get_price: (cTokenBalance, borrowBalance, exchangeRateMantissa) = snapshot
    q_get_price --> q_price_fail: oracle.getUnderlyingPrice(asset) == 0
    q_price_fail --> [*]: return (PRICE_ERROR, 0, 0)
    q_get_price --> q_calc_collateral: oraclePrice > 0
    q_calc_collateral --> q_calc_borrow: tokensToDenom = collateralFactor * exchangeRate * oraclePrice; sumCollateral += tokensToDenom * cTokenBalance
    q_calc_borrow --> q_iter: sumBorrowPlusEffects += oraclePrice * borrowBalance
    q_iter --> q_compare: all assets processed
    q_compare --> q_surplus: sumCollateral > sumBorrowPlusEffects
    q_surplus --> [*]: return (NO_ERROR, sumCollateral - sumBorrowPlusEffects, 0)
    q_compare --> q_shortfall: sumCollateral <= sumBorrowPlusEffects
    q_shortfall --> [*]: return (NO_ERROR, 0, sumBorrowPlusEffects - sumCollateral)

    note right of q_calc_collateral
        INV-001: collateral = sum(cTokenBalance * exchangeRate * collateralFactor * price) for all entered markets
        INV-002: borrows = sum(borrowBalance * price) for all entered markets
    end note

    note right of q_compare
        INV-003: At most one of liquidity or shortfall is non-zero
        INV-004: Shortfall > 0 means account is subject to liquidation
        INV-005: Oracle price of 0 is treated as error (not zero collateral)
    end note
